Bugs under Mac OSX -- March 08, 2004

After libepix.a is archived (ar -ru in the Makefile), ranlib should be
run. With the Dec2002 Developer Tools (other versions unknown), it is 
necessary to run ranlib manually on the installed library:

  make install
  sudo ranlib /usr/local/lib/libepix.a

(Adjust accordingly, using your INSTALL directory.)
